# Test: unquote-splicing in call argument position (MH2)
# A macro with variadic args splices them into a call via [unquote-splicing].
# This exercises the collect_seq_elements path in eval_quote_preprocess.
[macro sum-spliced [let ...args]
  [quote [+ [unquote-splicing args]]]]

[sum-spliced 10 20]
=== error
[E002] undefined variable: unquote-splicing (did you mean the string "unquote-splicing"? Use quotes.) (defined at 4:14-4:30)
  in [+ ...] at 4:10-4:37

=== warn
arity mismatch: expected 2 argument(s), got 1 (1 positional, 0 named) at 4:10-4:37
